msgstr ""

#: includes/class-pncp-admin.php:849
msgid "the header is read only when the request comes from a proxy you trust. Otherwise anyone could write any IP they want and bypass limits and blocks. CF-Connecting-IP: only from Cloudflare. X-Real-IP / X-Forwarded-For: from Bunny CDN, the server itself or a private network (Nginx in front of Apache). True-Client-IP: only from the proxies in the list."
msgstr ""

