msgstr ""

#: includes/class-pncp-admin.php:855
msgid "On because this is how version 1.4 worked. Fill in your proxies below and uncheck it. Once turned off, it cannot be turned on again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-pncp-admin.php:858
